import Mathlib

/-!
# Published theta constants for the moduli 3 through 105

The scaledCoefficient field represents the decimal value of c_theta multiplied by 10^7.
The source columns are c_theta (sixth) and xtheta (third) after the header.
The analytic cutoff x₂ and scaled ψ coefficient are taken from columns 2 and 5
of the coefficient table. The scale for both coefficients is 10^7.
Only comparisons of the published numbers are proved in this file.

* http://www.nt.math.ubc.ca/BeMaObRe/c-psi-theta-pi/c_all_rounded.txt
* http://www.nt.math.ubc.ca/BeMaObRe/x-psi-theta-pi/x0-all-xm-xe.txt

The SHA-256 digests of the source headers plus the next 103 rows (original
bytes) are 9921ec224e6e847aac89eeecff17a0489c43f4bf71d9e42aa4b15fadbf28791f
and 6ee8923ec1472f48611af2fb30f05d1e60df8e9bc8c898edcda62ebc00824988.
-/

